flowchart TD
    SWITCH[switch account] --> SET[set current id]
    SET --> REPOINT[account-aware state flatMapLatest -> new account]
    REPOINT --> ISO{all queries filter by accountId?}
    ISO -->|yes| CLEAN[isolated view]
    ISO -->|no| LEAK[cross-account LEAK - fix filter]
    INFLIGHT[in-flight work] --> TAG{tagged with accountId?}
    TAG -->|yes| CORRECT[writes to its account]
    TAG -->|no| WRONG[writes to current - bug]
